@startuml
class Student {
  studentId
  name
  viewAvailability()
  bookRoom()
  cancelBooking()
}

class Room {
  roomId
  capacity
  blocked
  block()
  unblock()
}

class Booking {
  bookingId
  startTime
  endTime
  status
  confirm()
  cancel()
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : assigned to

note right of Booking
R1: startTime must be in the future and duration must be > 0.
R1/R2: duration is at most 2 hours.
R2: active bookings for the same room cannot overlap.
end note

note right of Room
R3: blocked rooms cannot accept new bookings.
end note
@enduml
